message: "If you use DIAVLO MIND or its benchmark in your work, please cite the repository."
type: software
title: "DIAVLO MIND: an Agent Skills framework with a benchmark that measures what it changes"
abstract: >-
  A working method for AI agents packaged as an Agent Skill, a Claude Code plugin with eight
  role agents, four portable system prompts and a multi-provider orchestrator, together with
  an eight-task benchmark with hidden checks and the results of a 96-run pilot.
authors:
  - name: "Diavlo"
